Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.32,Sakakura Sakura,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Opening Skit ===
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Tomorrow is Shiki-san's birthday, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:11.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's a day early, but happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:12.44,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:17.96,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I used to think a birthday was just a number increasing by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:22.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's a very rational way to put it, Shiki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:25.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But it's not just that now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:26.79,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:34.76,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That "one" represents the time spent singing with everyone and being supported by so many people on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.60,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's an important birthday to celebrate that "one."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:46.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm glad you've come to think that way through school idol activities, Shiki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:51.52,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Ren-senpai, it's time to give Shiki-senpai "that."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.31,0:00:53.02,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"That"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:01:00.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}This is a present for you from Tomari-san and me, Team Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Happy birthday once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:05.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Even if it is a day early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:08.48,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:15.24,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Since Liella! will celebrate together tomorrow, let's celebrate as this team today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:21.32,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}A chestnut-shaped brooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.92,0:03:38.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's a bit early, but here's a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:23.88,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.92,0:01:32.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We wanted something related to flowers or vegetables for Team Green, and Tomari-san suggested this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:38.24,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I thought you'd like it since they're your favorite, Shiki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:39.45,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:40.76,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:42.24,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:44.52,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Ren-senpai, Tomari-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:48.32,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}This brooch is small and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:49.51,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:51.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's a simple and nice design.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:02:00.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Actually, I saw others at the shop and liked them so much I got this for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:04.20,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}A sweet potato brooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:07.24,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You bought one for yourself too, Tomari-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:11.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We think alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:16.32,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Ren-senpai, is that a strawberry brooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.36,0:02:20.56,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The shapes are different, but are these matching items?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:29.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Chestnut, sweet potato, and strawberry... they're different, but I think they count as matching items for Team Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:34.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's start the radio wearing our matching brooches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:36.48,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:53.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Love Live! Superstar!! Yuigaoka Lunchtime Broadcast,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:54.34,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Lieraji!
Comment: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:03.28,Ookuma Wakana,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Self-Introductions ===
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:03.28,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Hello, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:06.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm Sakakura Sakura, the voice of Tomari Onitsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:08.68,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'm Ookuma Wakana, the voice of Shiki Wakana!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:11.46,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'm Aoyama Nagisa, the voice of Ren Hazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:12.44,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}We are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:13.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:14.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:16.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:22.10,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}For the next two weeks, Team Green will be handling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:24.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}the Liella! radio hosting duties again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:25.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.87,0:03:26.37,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:30.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Tomorrow, June 17th, we're releasing the Chuu-Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:36.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}2nd theme song CD, "Koi no Tutorial"!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:37.80,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Wow, that was fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:39.22,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:44.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's the song with the heart-throbbing lines from episode 5 in the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:46.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Please check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:47.40,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Please do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:47.93,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Please do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:53.35,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And tomorrow, June 17th, is Shiki Wakana-chan's birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:54.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:55.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Happy birthday, Shiki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:56.25,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:04:00.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone, please celebrate on social media tomorrow too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.28,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Please do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:01.88,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:11.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And we have a message for Team Green from Team Children, who hosted last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:15.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}They want to know our favorite green things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:17.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Green things...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:18.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Apparently, anything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.64,0:04:26.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Food, clothes, items, app icons, hand soap, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:28.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}So anything goes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:29.03,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:30.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I see, anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:30.47,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:32.54,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Favorite green things...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}For me, it's matcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:34.75,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:35.33,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:36.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That was mentioned in Chuu-Liella!, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You got exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:39.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:40.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I do love matcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:44.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}My in-ear monitors are green.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:45.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:45.77,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I really like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:50.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}So you have the same color as Sumire-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:50.73,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:52.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:52.79,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:53.43,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:59.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, green is my theme color, Shiki-chan's color...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:00.01,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:02.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Shiki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:02.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:07.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Shiki-chan's name itself feels green.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And Wakana-chan's name too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:10.77,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The kanji is a bit different, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:13.35,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:14.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But I do like green.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:15.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Green is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:16.27,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's cute, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:16.89,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:18.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:19.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Is that good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:23.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Shall we move on to the mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:24.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:27.18,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone, please stay with us until the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:30.10,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Love Live! Superstar!! Yuigaoka Lunchtime Broadcast,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:33.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Lieraji! Let's Super Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:40.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Love Live! Superstar!! Yuigaoka Lunchtime Broadcast,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:41.22,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Lieraji!
Comment: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:50.00,Sakakura Sakura,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Suggestion Box ===
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:50.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The Yuigaoka Girls' High School Suggestion Box segment, where we introduce your mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:55.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's say it together! One, two... Suggestion Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:57.04,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Now, let's introduce some mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:57.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:05:59.96,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Radio name: Chiipan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:02.84,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:08.22,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I heard "Skip Capsule" in the Liella! Club CD Set 2024 preview video.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:13.36,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Just like the title says, the light melody makes me want to skip. It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:18.34,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What struck me most was the atmosphere of walking home after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:25.54,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It really captured the fun of those casual moments, like humming or playing games with friends on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:30.24,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's a bright and fun song, but it also warms your heart. It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.40,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I can't wait for the CD to arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:33.04,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:34.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:35.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:38.60,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Next is from Radio name: Utsuwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:39.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:40.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:44.20,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The info for the new song "Skip Capsule" has been released!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:44.65,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:50.14,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The jacket art of the 11 of them going somewhere together is so healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:57.74,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Seeing Natsumi-chan leading Kanon-chan by the hand reminded me of the Hokkaido scene in Season 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:07:02.90,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I was moved seeing that Natsumi-chan is now able to lead Kanon-chan like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:03.88,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you for the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:04.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:05.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:11.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The first chorus of "Skip Capsule" is out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:11.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:14.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The jacket illustration is so cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:13.37,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:13.79,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:15.60,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}So cute, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:16.05,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:19.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It has such a nice everyday feel to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:21.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, it's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:27.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Some fans are speculating that the members are grouped by their teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:28.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}They are standing close together, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:29.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:30.41,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:30.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:31.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:32.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:34.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's so lively and fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:39.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm so happy to see Ren-chan smiling so brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:37.85,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:41.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:42.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:44.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}She's poking Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.39,0:07:44.89,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}She is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.43,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}She really does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:48.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And Shiki-chan is watching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:48.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:50.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}She's definitely watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:52.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}She's staring right at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:53.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone, be careful on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:54.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:55.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}They aren't looking at the stairs at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:56.62,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:57.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.77,0:07:58.27,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:08:01.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I wonder which way Sumire-chan will go after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:03.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Up or down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It looks like she's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:06.01,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:07.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Because they're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:08.13,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:10.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Those stairs are impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:14.34,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"Skip Capsule," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:15.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's the kind of song Liella! didn't really have before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:18.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It feels fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:18.83,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:20.71,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's a fun song.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.51,0:08:21.01,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:21.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:22.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It really makes you want to skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:23.43,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:25.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I want everyone to hear the full version soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:25.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:33.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I want people to pay attention to the lyrics and vocals from the second verse onwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:29.67,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:35.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Please look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:35.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Please do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:42.28,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Next is from Radio name: Lyrical Trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:44.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.40,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The preview video for the Love Live! Superstar!! Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:50.64,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Club CD Set 2024 has been released!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.51,0:08:51.01,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:58.96,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}There are so many bonus videos, but I'm especially interested in the Tokyo Sightseeing Bus Tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:01.40,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I can't wait to see the full version!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:02.04,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:04.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:07.60,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Next is from Radio name: Polaris.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:08.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:09.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:10.24,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I watched the Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:12.98,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Club 2024 preview video.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:16.74,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was raining as usual, which strangely made me feel at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:22.74,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Maybe if you make member-themed teru teru bozu dolls and hang them up, it'll be sunny next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:25.00,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you for the suggestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:26.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:29.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Even though it was just a preview, it was pretty packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:30.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:31.73,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:34.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I was like, "Is it okay to show this much?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:34.45,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was that kind of video.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:36.55,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:37.11,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:42.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But we filmed so much more than that, so please watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:42.49,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:43.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The weather, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:44.67,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The weather, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:48.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But in the preview video, we didn't actually say it was raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:50.50,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:49.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But you can clearly see the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:51.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:58.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Wakana-chan, that umbrella project for the Chuu-Liella segment in August... that was crazy, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:57.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That was intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:09:58.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The boat part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:05.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I was told to go up, but in the end, I was left all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Is that what happened, Wakana-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:07.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Nobody came to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:15.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We promised to take photos up there after checking things out, but then nobody showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:19.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I think my umbrella blew away and I said it was impossible, so everyone retreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:21.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}So you were the guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:22.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But I was waiting for you all the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You were shouting all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:24.67,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:28.63,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I was watching and wondering what kind of scene that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:26.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.55,0:10:29.05,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:29.33,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:31.11,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:31.25,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:35.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We rode in a rickshaw, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:34.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:39.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The rickshaw had a rain cover in front, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:40.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:43.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was there, but we still got soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:44.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:45.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The rain gets in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:46.07,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:54.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was freezing that day, so they gave us warm blankets, but even those got drenched.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:48.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:55.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's how hard it was raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:11:02.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The lady pulling the rickshaw felt so bad, she worked so hard for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:10:59.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}She did, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:02.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:06.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Why does it always rain when we do things?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:07.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:08.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I really wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:14.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What about that idea of making member-themed teru teru bozu dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:12.13,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:15.17,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:18.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}If we make those and it still rains, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:19.41,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:20.09,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:23.14,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}There would be no hope left, so we can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:23.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's too scary to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:26.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's save it for a really important moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:27.57,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What if it rains even then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:30.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}There'd be no saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.20,0:11:32.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Maybe if we just make a lot of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:35.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We'll have everyone make them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:35.81,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:36.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We'll just have to pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:38.89,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:40.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I hope it's sunny next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:40.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:42.30,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I really want to make it sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:43.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I wonder if it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:45.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:46.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:50.26,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Next is from Radio name: Onina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:51.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:55.81,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I watched the Chuu-Liella Tutorial episodes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:56.41,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:56.91,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:12:00.68,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The theme song for the show has finally been fully revealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:00.85,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:27.56,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The ad-libbed lines from everyone in the Chuu-Liella Tutorial segments were so cute and funny, it was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:41.88,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}With the final episode approaching, the project for the event in August... what did she say in the Chuu-Liella segment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:27.93,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:42.19,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.19,0:12:48.72,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yabuchan's idea for acupressure push-sumo sounds hilarious and like it'll be a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:49.03,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:53.60,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The two members of Time Machine 3-go are also confirmed to appear, so I'm really looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:53.60,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:54.24,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:55.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:55.38,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:56.46,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:57.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.37,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.37,0:13:23.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}In episode 10, we performed the theme song "Koi no Tutorial"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:25.45,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:25.85,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}A total solo performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:26.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:27.09,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:28.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}In Liella! songs,
Comment: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:32.92,Sakakura Sakura,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Closing ===
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:32.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}we haven't really had the center girl singing the whole time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:33.53,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}No, we haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:34.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}So it feels fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:35.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It feels really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:36.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:42.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Not just for Aya-chan, but I thought this song really suits Natsumi-chan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:42.75,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:44.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:46.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I think it's a perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:47.39,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:53.54,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}During recording, you're singing as the character using words you actually said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:50.89,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:55.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That was actually quite difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:55.95,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:14:10.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Like with the "100x confidence" line, I wondered how far I should go as Tomari. It was tough, but I'm excited to see how it'll be live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:13:58.75,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:21.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Also, in episode 5, there was talk about the cast's silly actions becoming part of the dance choreography.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:18.13,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:21.57,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:22.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I wonder how that will turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:24.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:26.42,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It sounds intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:29.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}There might be movements we've never done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:29.65,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:30.17,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:31.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:35.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You never know what they'll use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:36.63,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:37.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:38.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:45.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}This is for the Chuu-Liella project...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:47.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I wonder if we can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:46.51,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:50.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}How will it turn out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:48.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.56,0:14:49.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I wanted to try it, but that helium gas...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.66,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Kuma thought of that, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:53.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:55.27,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But Liyuu tried it, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:55.85,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:57.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Her voice barely changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Liyuu doesn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:14:58.98,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:00.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Mine changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Mine changed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:02.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:03.05,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:03.77,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:04.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What we'll be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:05.03,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:08.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I really don't want to do acupressure push-sumo, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:12.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}There's a live performance after the acupressure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:17.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}If my feet are in so much pain that I can't move, that's no good. Let's not do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's not, Wakana-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:21.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:23.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}She was going to sacrifice herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Pei-chan's idea seems the safest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:25.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:26.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:27.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:28.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It seems like it'll be peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:28.85,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:30.02,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:30.25,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.02,0:15:31.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone can do it together too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:32.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:36.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Do you remember what ideas Nagi-chan and I submitted?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:37.90,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The project ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:38.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, I did submit one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.28,0:15:40.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:40.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:42.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}All 11 of us submitted ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:51.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Mine was having the cast pretend to be staff members...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:47.89,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:50.91,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:56.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And sneak into the audience, like a hidden camera thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:54.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, that's interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:55.83,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:16:00.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Like pretending to be a cameraman so we don't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:03.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I suggested going into the crowd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:04.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:07.30,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Mine was a jump platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:18:00.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I used to do jump-ins when coming onto the stage... and I did summer diaries too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:00.67,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Diaries, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I did those.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:01.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's so nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:04.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I did them all the time during summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:04.77,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I used to write such lazy diaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:07.03,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:12.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You start by growing something and you have to keep an observation diary with drawings, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:13.11,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:16.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But I'd skip a few days and then suddenly the flower would be in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:17.19,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:18.64,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You just summarized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:20.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'd look at a reference book to draw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:21.35,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:25.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Nagi-chan, has your drawing style been like that since elementary school?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:26.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:27.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:28.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.68,0:18:30.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, did you improve?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:31.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Since elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, I can draw morning glories and things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:34.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:35.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}As long as it's not a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:37.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'll have you draw something next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:39.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, let's have her draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:42.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But her drawings of people have gotten much better too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.99,0:18:40.49,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.63,0:18:43.13,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I think I've improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:44.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I really think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I was like, "Wow, she's good!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:47.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I've been forced to draw so much over these past five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:48.43,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:49.26,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:50.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Humans really do grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:52.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:52.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You draw a lot for the Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:54.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Club too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:54.55,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:55.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Don't we have a lot of opportunities to draw for the Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:18:57.31,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.31,0:18:57.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}So many.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:18:58.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:18:59.22,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}On purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.81,0:18:59.31,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:00.29,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:02.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, you're pretty much the same, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:03.39,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:06.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}No, I don't think I'm good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:07.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I don't think I am either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}When did I ever say I was good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:15.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The other day, we had to draw portraits of the members, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:18.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, the caricatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:20.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I was the only one who had to do a redraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:21.43,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:22.53,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:25.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}They said it was so bad I had to redraw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:26.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What kind of drawing did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.17,0:19:27.73,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:29.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I just drew Shiki-chan normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:04.10,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, Nagi-chan's Ren-chan... I wouldn't say it's "good," but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:06.59,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It actually looks like Ren-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:07.22,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:11.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You can tell she's drawing Ren-chan. Maybe yours didn't convey that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:14.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Maybe they thought I didn't have enough love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:17.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Now I really want to see what you drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:20.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, Shiki-chan has a pretty simple hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:21.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's hard, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:22.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The bangs and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:24.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:26.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The balance was difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.11,0:20:26.61,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:28.83,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:29.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:29.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:30.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:31.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:33.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}They told me to draw it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:35.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Was the second one okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The second one was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:36.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:45.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The second time, I was going to just leave the paper and go home, but they made me wait for confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:47.87,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:49.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:57.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}They said it was okay, but then everyone had to check it before I got the final OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:54.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:58.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:20:59.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Even Shiki gave the OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:00.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:01.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:02.50,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Did you change the style?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:04.18,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, I think I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.95,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You changed your artistic style?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:05.09,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:06.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:12.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I realized drawing it too realistically wasn't good, so I went for something more "pop."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.69,0:21:12.19,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:14.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Like a chibi character.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:16.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The kind of style Nako-chan would draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:20.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was fine once I drew it in that softer style.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:20.85,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:21.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You can actually do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:22.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:24.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}So you can do both styles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:24.81,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:25.81,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.72,0:21:35.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I was staring so hard at Shiki-chan's face while trying to sketch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:35.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:36.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:36.98,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:38.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You overdid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:38.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:40.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But when I drew her in my own cute way...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.21,0:21:41.73,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:42.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.97,0:21:43.47,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:44.17,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.64,0:21:49.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}In those cases, I usually draw several versions of Ren-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:50.39,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:52.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And then I tell them to pick their favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:55.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yuina also drew about six versions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.31,0:21:56.81,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.87,0:21:57.37,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:06.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Since I know I'm not great, even if I think it's cute, they might not agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:21:58.83,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.49,0:22:03.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:08.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone has different values, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:09.30,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}A bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.39,0:22:09.89,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:10.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:12.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I recommend drawing a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:13.19,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:13.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.84,0:22:15.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Providing several options.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.01,0:22:15.51,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}To choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:17.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What are we talking about again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:18.18,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:18.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We ended up talking about drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.36,0:22:20.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The green talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:21.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The green talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:22.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The loofah talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:24.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.48,0:22:25.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you very much.
Comment: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:29.16,Sakakura Sakura,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Closing ===
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:29.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And that's all for the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:29.35,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:31.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you all for so many emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:32.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Comment: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:36.10,Sakakura Sakura,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Lunchtime Request ===
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:36.10,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Now, let's introduce a Lunchtime Request email.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:38.74,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Radio name: Shima-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:39.66,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.66,0:22:40.72,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.72,0:22:41.60,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:42.64,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}This is my first email.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:45.24,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}My request is "Killer Kyun."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:47.50,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}When I first heard this song, I was like, "What is this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:52.08,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's so much fun that I thought it would help me get through my afternoon work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.56,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you for the request.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.21,0:22:53.71,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:54.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:57.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"Killer Kyun" really gets you hyped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.77,0:22:58.27,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.47,0:22:58.97,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.56,0:23:00.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.06,0:23:00.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Okay.
Comment: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:02.08,Sakakura Sakura,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Lunchtime Request ===
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:02.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:04.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Liella! with "Killer Kyun."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.03,0:23:08.53,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.04,0:23:09.82,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Is it time to finish work?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.82,0:23:11.62,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Are you ready for tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.62,0:23:15.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Make sure to do your deep care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:16.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Don't make me say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:18.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Don't let them take your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:22.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I want to stay cute with a cool face, but my mental state isn't cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:25.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Time to sleep, mumble mumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.72,0:23:34.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Raise your hand to speak, the night isn't over, let's talk for 20 more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:38.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You're totally falling for me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.88,0:23:40.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We'll meet soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.23,0:23:41.73,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Shaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:46.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Excitement flying, very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.24,0:23:48.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Deep breath, in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:52.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's stay our usual selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.80,0:23:55.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'll definitely make you say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.72,0:23:59.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}My heart is throbbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:03.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}This Killer Kyun is driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.40,0:24:09.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}What are you whispering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:10.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I can make a request.
